MatchedObjectDescriptor.QualificationSummary:
Your resume must demonstrate at least one year of specialized experience at or equivalent to the GS-07 grade level or pay band in the Federal service or equivalent experience in the private or public sector. Specialized experience must demonstrate the following: 1) Experience instructing employees on specific tasks and firefighting techniques;
2) Experience preparing and submitting a variety of documentation such as reports, schedules, checklists, and data files;
3) Experience performing structural firefighting duties for a variety of facilities that may include research and/or large industrial complexes;
4) Experience performing crash-rescue and firefighting duties involving air traffic or support operations;
5) Experience performing hazard and risk assessments; and
6) Experience performing basic life support, initiating established medical protocols. **This position requires the incumbent to be certified as: Firefighter II, Airport Rescue Firefighting (ARFF), Apparatus Driver-Operator for Pumper, Aerial vehicles, HAZMAT Operations Level, HAZMAT Technician Level, CPR and First Responder First Aid, National Registry Emergency Medical Technician - Basic Life Support (NREMT-B) certification, Fire Officer I, Fire Inspector I, and Fire Instructor I levels (under NFPA standards adopted by DoD). If you do not possess all of the above certifications and you have not attached copies of your certifications, you will be rated ineligible.** Additional qualification information can be found from the following Office of Personnel Management website:
https://www.opm.gov/policy-data-oversight/classification-qualifications/general-schedule-qualification-standards/0000/fire-protection-and-prevention-series-0081/ Experience refers to paid and unpaid experience, including volunteer work done through National Service programs (e.g., professional, philanthropic, religious, spiritual, community, student, social). Volunteer work helps build critical competencies, knowledge, and skills and can provide valuable training and experience that translates directly to paid employment.
